}
</action>
```

Valid `extract_symbol` for a top-level function:
```xml
<action>
{
  "type": "extract_symbol",
  "path": "app/src/main/java/com/example/feature/Formatter.kt",
  "symbol_name": "formatTimestamp",
  "symbol_kind": "function",
